      [SUPERSEDED NOTE] The GUARD G2' failure above is a defect in THE GUARD, not in the fit.
      profile_chi2 minimises |DL_model*(1-A) - sum x_a T_a - DL_fid|^2, so the fitted model has
      amplitude (1-A) and template coefficients MINUS x_a; the guard rebuilt it with (1+A) and
      PLUS x_a, i.e. both signs wrong.  L147_verify_cmb_profile.py redoes the check correctly and
      PASSES 4/4: linear reconstruction 7.79 vs profiled 7.79, EXACT CAMB 8.99, and an INDEPENDENT
      nonlinear minimisation with real CAMB at every step 7.83.  f_cmb_min = 0.9877 stands.

